
PicEase respects your privacy. This app is designed to process images on your device and does not collect, store, sell, or share your personal data.

Data Collection

PicEase does not collect any personal information, analytics data, tracking data, device identifiers, usage history, photos, image metadata, or uploaded files from users.

Photo Access

PicEase may ask for access to your photo library so you can select images to process or save processed images back to your library. The app only accesses the photos you choose or the save action you request. Your photos are not uploaded to any server by PicEase.

Image Processing

Image compression, resizing, format conversion, metadata removal, watermarking, and batch renaming are performed on your device. Processed images remain under your control and are saved or shared only when you choose to do so.

Sharing

When you use the system share sheet, the selected processed images are passed to iOS sharing services that you choose, such as Messages, Mail, AirDrop, or other installed apps. PicEase does not control the privacy practices of third-party apps or services.

No Tracking

PicEase does not use tracking technologies, advertising identifiers, third-party analytics SDKs, or advertising SDKs.

Children's Privacy

PicEase does not knowingly collect data from children or any other users.

Changes to This Policy

This privacy policy may be updated if the app's features or data practices change. Any future changes will be reflected in the updated policy text.

Contact

If you have questions about this privacy policy, please contact the app developer through the support contact listed on the App Store.
